{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>By words</b> — a servant is not disciplined by words alone; with a rod and reproofs it is fitting to discipline him." "<b>For he understands</b> — even though he understands the discipline, he will not answer the one disciplining him to say, 'I will do so.'"], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:25:24.984713170Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}